    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Pyrite Talisman",
    "steam_appid": 3063900,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annelise lives in the year 2100.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a burning flame, one morning like many others, she glimpses a female figure absolutely identical to her. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063900/extras/5886b5172c83eec75a9b035b398c93b4.avif?t=1751716386\" width=500 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that moment her life will change. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She'll have to know why she can see the other her but she can't speak to her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She'll have to search for informations on ancient tomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She'll have to solve puzzles and pass trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She'll have to learn how to harness ancient powers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And in the meantime she will learn about the existence of a prophecy, of an angry Supreme God, of the arrival of Four Plagues dooming the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She will understand to be part of something totally unexpected and too big for her to manage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>And that somewhere in time, she is not alone.</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063900/extras/cbc84643bb52ee2fbc1ad03c0675969e.avif?t=1751716386\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Annelise in her quest to get and empower the epic Pyrite Talisman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the barrier of time separating Annelise from the other Her and share the knowledge to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pyrite Talisman is a 3D narrative adventure involving exploration in third person direct movement, puzzle solving and inventory use through a point &amp; click interface and it's the prequel to Telluria: Forebodings. During gameplay you will play with both characters switching through time to collect informations to progress further into the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtitles and interface in english and italian.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the Telluria project on our socials.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annelise lives in the year 2100.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a burning flame, one morning like many others, she glimpses a female figure absolutely identical to her. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063900/extras/5886b5172c83eec75a9b035b398c93b4.avif?t=1751716386\" width=500 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that moment her life will change. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She'll have to know why she can see the other her but she can't speak to her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She'll have to search for informations on ancient tomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She'll have to solve puzzles and pass trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She'll have to learn how to harness ancient powers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And in the meantime she will learn about the existence of a prophecy, of an angry Supreme God, of the arrival of Four Plagues dooming the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She will understand to be part of something totally unexpected and too big for her to manage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>And that somewhere in time, she is not alone.</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063900/extras/cbc84643bb52ee2fbc1ad03c0675969e.avif?t=1751716386\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Annelise in her quest to get and empower the epic Pyrite Talisman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the barrier of time separating Annelise from the other Her and share the knowledge to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pyrite Talisman is a 3D narrative adventure involving exploration in third person direct movement, puzzle solving and inventory use through a point &amp; click interface and it's the prequel to Telluria: Forebodings. During gameplay you will play with both characters switching through time to collect informations to progress further into the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtitles and interface in english and italian.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the Telluria project on our socials.</p>",
    "short_description": "Two Souls, One Path. Not even time can keep them apart.Annelise is the Chosen One of an ancient Prophecy. Cross time and space with her to find and activate the epic Pyrite Talisman in a narrative adventure through two parallel realities.Prequel to Telluria: Forebodings.",
